{"title":"Python爬虫实战：urllib结合XPath与lxml的基础用法","slug":"2024-07-26-urllib_xpath的基本使用","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.115Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-urllib_xpath的基本使用.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在 Python 爬虫开发中，数据解析是核心环节之一。相较于正则表达式和 <code>BeautifulSoup</code>，<code>lxml</code> 库结合 <strong>XPath</strong> 语法具有解析速度快、语法简洁、容错能力强等优势。本文将基于 <code>lxml.etree</code> 模块，详细介绍如何解析本地文件及服务器响应数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境准备\"><a href=\"#环境准备\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"环境准备\"></a>环境准备</h2><p>在使用前，请确保已安装 <code>lxml</code> 库。若未安装，可通过以下命令安装：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br><span class=\"line\">118</span><br><span class=\"line\">119</span><br><span class=\"line\">120</span><br><span class=\"line\">121</span><br><span class=\"line\">122</span><br><span class=\"line\">123</span><br><span class=\"line\">124</span><br><span class=\"line\">125</span><br><span class=\"line\">126</span><br><span class=\"line\">127</span><br><span class=\"line\">128</span><br><span class=\"line\">129</span><br><span class=\"line\">130</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">pip install lxml</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 核心模块导入</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`lxml` 库中的 `etree` 模块是处理 XML 和 HTML 的核心工具。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 两种解析场景</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在实际爬虫过程中，我们通常面临两种数据来源：本地存储的 HTML 文件和网络请求返回的字符串数据。`etree` 提供了对应的方法进行处理。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. 解析本地 HTML 文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">如果你已经将网页保存到本地（例如 `test.html`），可以使用 `etree.parse` 方法直接解析。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码示例：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 解析本地 HTML 文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：parse 方法默认解析的是 XML 格式，如果 HTML 标签不规范可能会报错</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 此时通常配合 HTMLParser 使用</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">parser = etree.HTMLParser(encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.parse(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;test.html&#x27;</span>, parser)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打印解析后的对象，成功则返回 Element 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># print(tree) # 输出: &lt;lxml.etree._ElementTree object at ...&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 解析服务器响应数据（网络爬虫常用）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在爬虫中，我们通常使用 `urllib` 或 `requests` 获取网页源码（字符串格式），此时应使用 `etree.HTML()` 进行解析。它能自动修正不规范的 HTML 标签。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码示例：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\">import urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 模拟获取网页源码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;http://example.com&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 解析服务器响应的字符串数据</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.HTML(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 此时 tree 是一个 Element 对象，可以进行 XPath 提取</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## XPath 基本语法实战</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">解析得到 `tree` 对象后，即可使用 `.xpath()` 方法配合 XPath 路径表达式提取数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 常用路径表达式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 表达式 | 说明 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `/` | 从根节点选取（直接子节点）。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `//` | 从匹配选择的当前节点选择文档中的节点，而不考虑它们的位置（常用）。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `.` | 选取当前节点。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `..` | 选取当前节点的父节点。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `@` | 选取属性。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码实战演示</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设 `test.html` 内容如下：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```html</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;html&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &lt;body&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &lt;div class=<span class=\"string\">&quot;content&quot;</span>&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &lt;ul&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item1&quot;</span>&gt;数据挖掘&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item2&quot;</span>&gt;机器学习&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item3&quot;</span>&gt;深度学习&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &lt;/ul&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &lt;/body&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;/html&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">**提取逻辑代码：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 为演示方便，这里直接解析字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">html_data = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"string\">&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&lt;html&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &lt;body&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &lt;div class=&quot;</span>content<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      &lt;ul&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item1<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;数据挖掘&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item2<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;机器学习&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item3<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;深度学习&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      &lt;/ul&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &lt;/div&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &lt;/body&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&lt;/html&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&quot;</span><span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.HTML(html_data)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 获取所有 li 标签的文本内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 // 表示层级查找，text() 获取文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">li_texts = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;所有文本: &#123;li_texts&#125;&quot;</span>) </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: [&#x27;数据挖掘&#x27;, &#x27;机器学习&#x27;, &#x27;深度学习&#x27;]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 获取指定属性的 li 标签内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 [@attr=&#x27;value&#x27;] 进行属性定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">specific_li = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li[@id=&quot;item2&quot;]/text()&#x27;</span>)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;指定ID内容: &#123;specific_li&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 机器学习</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 获取标签的属性值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 @attr 获取属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">attr_value = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li[@id=&quot;item1&quot;]/@id&#x27;</span>)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;属性值: &#123;attr_value&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: item1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 查找指定层级的节点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查找 class 为 content 的 div 下的所有 li</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">div_li = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//div[@class=&quot;content&quot;]//li/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;层级查找: &#123;div_li&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了 `urllib` 结合 `lxml` 进行数据解析的基础用法。核心要点如下：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **区分数据源**：本地文件用 `etree.parse()`，网络字符串用 `etree.HTML()`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **路径匹配**：熟练使用 `//` 进行全局查找，结合 `@` 定位属性和 `text()` 提取文本。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **返回值类型**：`xpath()` 方法始终返回一个列表，提取具体数据时需注意索引（如 `[0]`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握了这些基础，你就可以应对大部分网页的数据提取需求了。下一篇文章我们将深入讲解 XPath 的高级谓语用法。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在 Python 爬虫开发中，数据解析是核心环节之一。相较于正则表达式和 <code>BeautifulSoup</code>，<code>lxml</code> 库结合 <strong>XPath</strong> 语法具有解析速度快、语法简洁、容错能力强等优势。本文将基于 <code>lxml.etree</code> 模块，详细介绍如何解析本地文件及服务器响应数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境准备\"><a href=\"#环境准备\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"环境准备\"></a>环境准备</h2><p>在使用前，请确保已安装 <code>lxml</code> 库。若未安装，可通过以下命令安装：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br><span class=\"line\">118</span><br><span class=\"line\">119</span><br><span class=\"line\">120</span><br><span class=\"line\">121</span><br><span class=\"line\">122</span><br><span class=\"line\">123</span><br><span class=\"line\">124</span><br><span class=\"line\">125</span><br><span class=\"line\">126</span><br><span class=\"line\">127</span><br><span class=\"line\">128</span><br><span class=\"line\">129</span><br><span class=\"line\">130</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">pip install lxml</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 核心模块导入</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`lxml` 库中的 `etree` 模块是处理 XML 和 HTML 的核心工具。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 两种解析场景</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在实际爬虫过程中，我们通常面临两种数据来源：本地存储的 HTML 文件和网络请求返回的字符串数据。`etree` 提供了对应的方法进行处理。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. 解析本地 HTML 文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">如果你已经将网页保存到本地（例如 `test.html`），可以使用 `etree.parse` 方法直接解析。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码示例：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 解析本地 HTML 文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：parse 方法默认解析的是 XML 格式，如果 HTML 标签不规范可能会报错</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 此时通常配合 HTMLParser 使用</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">parser = etree.HTMLParser(encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.parse(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;test.html&#x27;</span>, parser)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打印解析后的对象，成功则返回 Element 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># print(tree) # 输出: &lt;lxml.etree._ElementTree object at ...&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 解析服务器响应数据（网络爬虫常用）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在爬虫中，我们通常使用 `urllib` 或 `requests` 获取网页源码（字符串格式），此时应使用 `etree.HTML()` 进行解析。它能自动修正不规范的 HTML 标签。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码示例：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\">import urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 模拟获取网页源码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;http://example.com&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 解析服务器响应的字符串数据</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.HTML(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 此时 tree 是一个 Element 对象，可以进行 XPath 提取</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## XPath 基本语法实战</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">解析得到 `tree` 对象后，即可使用 `.xpath()` 方法配合 XPath 路径表达式提取数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 常用路径表达式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 表达式 | 说明 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `/` | 从根节点选取（直接子节点）。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `//` | 从匹配选择的当前节点选择文档中的节点，而不考虑它们的位置（常用）。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `.` | 选取当前节点。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `..` | 选取当前节点的父节点。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `@` | 选取属性。 |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码实战演示</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设 `test.html` 内容如下：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```html</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;html&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &lt;body&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &lt;div class=<span class=\"string\">&quot;content&quot;</span>&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &lt;ul&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item1&quot;</span>&gt;数据挖掘&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item2&quot;</span>&gt;机器学习&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &lt;li <span class=\"built_in\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;item3&quot;</span>&gt;深度学习&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &lt;/ul&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &lt;/body&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;/html&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">**提取逻辑代码：**</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">from lxml import etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 为演示方便，这里直接解析字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">html_data = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"string\">&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&lt;html&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &lt;body&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &lt;div class=&quot;</span>content<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      &lt;ul&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item1<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;数据挖掘&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item2<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;机器学习&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">        &lt;li id=&quot;</span>item3<span class=\"string\">&quot;&gt;深度学习&lt;/li&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      &lt;/ul&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &lt;/div&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &lt;/body&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&lt;/html&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">&quot;</span><span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.HTML(html_data)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 获取所有 li 标签的文本内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 // 表示层级查找，text() 获取文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">li_texts = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;所有文本: &#123;li_texts&#125;&quot;</span>) </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: [&#x27;数据挖掘&#x27;, &#x27;机器学习&#x27;, &#x27;深度学习&#x27;]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 获取指定属性的 li 标签内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 [@attr=&#x27;value&#x27;] 进行属性定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">specific_li = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li[@id=&quot;item2&quot;]/text()&#x27;</span>)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;指定ID内容: &#123;specific_li&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 机器学习</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 获取标签的属性值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 @attr 获取属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">attr_value = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//li[@id=&quot;item1&quot;]/@id&#x27;</span>)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;属性值: &#123;attr_value&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: item1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 查找指定层级的节点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查找 class 为 content 的 div 下的所有 li</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">div_li = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//div[@class=&quot;content&quot;]//li/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(f<span class=\"string\">&quot;层级查找: &#123;div_li&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了 `urllib` 结合 `lxml` 进行数据解析的基础用法。核心要点如下：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **区分数据源**：本地文件用 `etree.parse()`，网络字符串用 `etree.HTML()`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **路径匹配**：熟练使用 `//` 进行全局查找，结合 `@` 定位属性和 `text()` 提取文本。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  **返回值类型**：`xpath()` 方法始终返回一个列表，提取具体数据时需注意索引（如 `[0]`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握了这些基础，你就可以应对大部分网页的数据提取需求了。下一篇文章我们将深入讲解 XPath 的高级谓语用法。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"爬虫技术","path":"api/categories/爬虫技术.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"XPath","path":"api/tags/XPath.json"},{"name":"lxml","path":"api/tags/lxml.json"}]}